# modClinicPay language file - en_US
ModuleClinicPayName=Clinic Charging
ModuleClinicPayDesc=Charge bills and prepaid cards: a charge bill creates a native invoice in the same transaction; prepaid count/value cards
ModuleClinicPayDescLong=Clinic charging module for TCM clinics: the front desk collects one visit's charges (registration/consultation/drugs/treatment/materials) into a charge bill; confirming creates a native invoice in the same transaction and registers the payment (cash/scan); prepaid count/value cards are sold and recharged as charge bills (invoice generated) and consumed by decrementing count or balance (no invoice); refunds go through a separate approval (credit note reversing the original + refund to source). All amounts go through calcul_price_total; card consumption is atomic; refund requires dual-person permission. V0.1 phase 1: skeleton (tables/rights/menu/patient tabs).
